@LearnApp.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5210

### List (paged): 200
GET {{LearnApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/contacts

### Search, sort, page: 200
GET {{LearnApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/contacts?search=a&sortBy=email&sortDir=desc&page=1&pageSize=2

### Invalid page number: 400 with a validation error
GET {{LearnApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/contacts?page=0

### Get one: 200
GET {{LearnApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/contacts/1

### Get missing: 404
GET {{LearnApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/contacts/999

### Create: 201 with a Location header
POST {{LearnApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/contacts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Grace",
  "lastName": "Hopper",
  "email": "grace.hopper@example.com",
  "phone": "555-0100"
}

### Create invalid (missing email, bad phone): 400 with field errors
POST {{LearnApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/contacts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "No",
  "lastName": "Email",
  "phone": "not-a-phone"
}

### Create duplicate email: 409 from the global handler
POST {{LearnApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/contacts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Maria",
  "lastName": "Again",
  "email": "maria.lopez@example.com"
}

### Update: 204
PUT {{LearnApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/contacts/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Maria",
  "lastName": "Lopez",
  "email": "maria.lopez@example.com",
  "phone": "555-0199"
}

### Delete: 204. Use the id from YOUR "Create" response (6 the first time; it goes up each time you create)
DELETE {{LearnApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/contacts/6

### Unexpected error: 500 ProblemDetails, with no secret and no stack trace
GET {{LearnApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/error-demo

### Step 1 and 2 demos (still work)
GET {{LearnApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/di-demo

###
GET {{LearnApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/ef-demo/by-city/Springfield